# AGENTS.md is generated by synthesize_agents_md.py, which inlines every ancestor
# .local.md from the operator's home tree downwards. It therefore carries personal filing
# conventions, private financial locations, residency and unrelated ventures alongside
# this repository's own guidance.
#
# This is the estate's one PUBLIC repository, so committing it would publish that, not
# merely share it internally. It is untracked today and must stay that way.
#
# The file stays on disk, where the watcher regenerates it and Claude Code reads it
# through the CLAUDE.md bridge. Ignoring it only stops it being shared.
AGENTS.md
